			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750360201,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，怎麼了？剛剛看你挖啊挖的，是挖出了什麼了不起的東西嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360202,
					"content": "啊，難道挖到了什麼值錢的寶藏？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360203,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360204,
					"content": "嗯…我來看看，這個看起來好像是什麼東西的種子…沒想到在這個看起來已經荒地的地方，還有辦法挖出這樣的東西…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360205,
					"content": "唔嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360206,
					"content": "不過這個看起來應該不是很值錢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360207,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360208,
						750360209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360208,
					"content": "種子蘊含的是無限可能…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750360210,
					"content": "不過，怎麼看都是已經荒廢的地方…土看起來都硬硬的，這個種子真的還活著嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360211,
					"content": "唔…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360212,
					"content": "你是在難過嗎…不過這個很難說啦，畢竟有些種子天生就沒有辦法發芽…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360213,
					"content": "不過我們就再種下去看看實際怎麼樣吧。也許只是因為挖的坑不好，也沒有足夠的營養，所以才到現在都還沒發芽。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360214,
					"content": "我們再好好種下去，說不定就會長出來喲！嘿嘿，會長出什麼呢…超大的顆粒果，嗯…超級超級香的苦種也不錯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360215,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360216,
					"content": "也許會長出騙騙花…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360217
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750360217,
					"content": "這種時候就不要掃興啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360218,
					"content": "不過納塔的植物會需要什麼營養呢…不管了，先種下去再說吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360209,
					"content": "說不定會長出了不起的東西！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360210
					]
				}
			]
		},
