			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750360401,
					"content": "嗯，這個深度應該就可以了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360402,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360403,
					"content": "讓我想想，要說納塔和其他國家不一樣的地方…那就是燃素了！替種子補充一下燃素說不定會有用？我們試試看吧！",
